@startuml
title PATCH /api/v1/pods/{pod_id}/visibility
hide footbox
actor Client
participant "FastAPI / Pydantic" as API
participant "SQLAlchemy session" as DB
database PostgreSQL as PG
Client -> API: PATCH /api/v1/pods/{pod_id}/visibility
API -> API: Verify Clerk bearer session; validate input
API -> DB: Resolve local caller; open transaction
DB -> PG: Lock pod FOR UPDATE; require owner (404/403)
DB -> PG: Update is_public from request; flush
PG --> DB: Updated row
DB --> API: Route result
API -> API: Validate / serialize response
API -> DB: Exit request transaction
DB -> PG: COMMIT
API --> Client: 200
note over API, PG: Failure rolls back; see auth.puml and transaction.puml.
@enduml
